<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.6900 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.6900 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.6900 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 74.8900 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 16		  Apr 15</p>
<p> High			     75.0000		 75.2000</p>
<p> Low				74.6800		 74.8500</p>
<p> Open			     75.0000		 75.2000</p>
<p> Close			    74.6900		 74.8900</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  4.345		   6.660</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
